4-602.13 The following nonfood contact surfaces were soiled: 
1) pizza cooler - bottom inside (crumbs);
2) retail Pepsi cooler used for drinks - bottom inside and door tracks (debris/dead insects);
3) retail 3 door Pepsi cooler - bottom inside/door tracks on right side and milk shelf (general debris/dead insects); 
4) reach-in freezer across from kitchen handwashing sink - bottom inside (crumbs); and
5) small fan on upper ledge above kitchen (dust).
PIC began cleaning retail coolers during inspection. Ensure cleaning inside cold holding units as needed to minimize buildup of debris.
Nonfood contact surfaces shall be cleaned at a frequency necessary to eliminate buildup of grease, food splash and general debris.
